== 6.6 Chapter 6 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [Foreign policy is best defined as],
  [membership of international organisations],
  [the work of ambassadors abroad],
  [the treaties a state has signed],
  [the sum of a state's actions towards other states in pursuit of its national interest]
)

#mcq(2, [Which of the following is a determinant of a country's foreign policy?],
  [The number of its political parties],
  [Its national interest and economic strength],
  [The colour of its flag],
  [The size of its civil service]
)

#mcq(3, [Nigeria's foreign policy is described as Africa-centred because],
